        <div style="display: flex; gap: var(--s-2); color: var(--text-muted); font-size: 0.9rem; margin-bottom: var(--s-2);">
          <span>📅 Feb 20, 2026</span>
          <span>⏱️ 7 min</span>
        </div>
        <a href="/blog/celpip-speaking-part2" class="btn btn-ghost">Read →</a>
      </article>

      <article class="card">
        <div style="display: inline-block; background: var(--accent-light); color: var(--accent); padding: var(--s-1) var(--s-2); border-radius: 4px; font-size: 0.85rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: var(--s-2);">
          Speaking
        </div>
        <h3 style="margin-top: 0;">IELTS Speaking Part 2 Cue Card Guide</h3>
        <p style="color: var(--text-muted); flex: 1;">Cue card strategy, 1-minute prep, and how to speak for the full 2 minutes without sounding memorized.</p>
        <div style="display: flex; gap: var(--s-2); color: var(--text-muted); font-size: 0.9rem; margin-bottom: var(--s-2);">
          <span>📅 Mar 14, 2026</span>
          <span>⏱️ 6 min</span>
        </div>
        <a href="/blog/ielts-speaking-part-2-cue-card" class="btn btn-ghost">Read →</a>
