      <article class="card">
        <div style="display: inline-block; background: var(--accent-light); color: var(--accent); padding: var(--s-1) var(--s-2); border-radius: 4px; font-size: 0.85rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: var(--s-2);">
          CELPIP Writing
        </div>
        <h3 style="margin-top: 0;">CELPIP Writing Task 1 Email Guide</h3>
        <p style="color: var(--text-muted); flex: 1;">Tone, structure, and what to include when students search specifically for CELPIP email writing help.</p>
        <div style="display: flex; gap: var(--s-2); color: var(--text-muted); font-size: 0.9rem; margin-bottom: var(--s-2);">
          <span>📅 Mar 14, 2026</span>
          <span>⏱️ 6 min</span>
        </div>
        <a href="/blog/celpip-writing-task-1-email" class="btn btn-ghost">Read →</a>
      </article>

      <article class="card">
        <div style="display: inline-block; background: var(--accent-light); color: var(--accent); padding: var(--s-1) var(--s-2); border-radius: 4px; font-size: 0.85rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: var(--s-2);">
          CELPIP Writing
        </div>
        <h3 style="margin-top: 0;">CELPIP Writing Task 2 Survey Response Guide</h3>
        <p style="color: var(--text-muted); flex: 1;">A task-level page for students who want stronger organization, clearer position, and CLB 9 writing control.</p>
