        </div>
        <a href="/blog/celpip-writing-task-2-survey-response" class="btn btn-ghost">Read →</a>
      </article>

      <article class="card">
        <div style="display: inline-block; background: var(--accent-light); color: var(--accent); padding: var(--s-1) var(--s-2); border-radius: 4px; font-size: 0.85rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: var(--s-2);">
          CELPIP Speaking
        </div>
        <h3 style="margin-top: 0;">CELPIP Speaking Task 1 Guide</h3>
        <p style="color: var(--text-muted); flex: 1;">How to structure personal-experience answers clearly and keep fluency under time pressure.</p>
        <div style="display: flex; gap: var(--s-2); color: var(--text-muted); font-size: 0.9rem; margin-bottom: var(--s-2);">
